{"id":"lp_test_01","pipeline":"LP","solver":"Pyke","dataset":"ProntoQA","text":"Wren is a tumpus. Every tumpus is a wumpus. Every wumpus is not metallic. Is Wren not metallic?","facts":["Tumpus(Wren, True)"],"rules":[[["Tumpus(person, True)"],"Wumpus(person, True)"],[["Wumpus(person, True)"],"Metallic(person, False)"]],"query":"Metallic(Wren, False)","expected_proved":true}
{"id":"fol_test_01","pipeline":"FOL","solver":"Prover9","dataset":"FOLIO","text":"No bird is a mammal. Tweety is a bird. Is Tweety a mammal?","formulation":"bird(tweety). all x (bird(x) -> -mammal(x)).","goal":"mammal(tweety).","expected_proved":false}
{"id":"csp_test_01","pipeline":"CSP","solver":"python-constraint","dataset":"LogicalDeduction","text":"Three people choose different numbers from 1 to 5 and their numbers sum to 9. What assignments are possible?","variables":[{"name":"Alice","domain":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"name":"Bob","domain":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"name":"Charlie","domain":[1,2,3,4,5]}],"constraints":[{"type":"all_different","variables":["Alice","Bob","Charlie"]},{"type":"exact_sum","variables":["Alice","Bob","Charlie"],"value":9}],"query":{"variables":["Alice","Bob","Charlie"]},"type":"all"}
{"id":"sat_test_01","pipeline":"SAT","solver":"Z3","dataset":"AR-LSAT","text":"Both Ada and Ben repair the radio, and exactly one of them repairs the antenna.","variables":["radio_Ada","radio_Ben","antenna_Ada","antenna_Ben"],"formulation":"radio_Ada & radio_Ben & Xor(antenna_Ada, antenna_Ben)","expected_satisfiable":true}
